1. two seats, one roster — spawn, overlap, isolation, clean stop
  ok    hermetic: worker-a spawns
  ok    hermetic: worker-b spawns
  ok    hermetic: each seat has its OWN FIFO (worker-a.stdin, worker-b.stdin)
  ok    hermetic: bead-a dispatched to worker-a
  ok    hermetic: bead-b dispatched to worker-b (before bead-a's turn ended)
